window.products.push({"id":679052,"name":"Touch of Class Traditional Woven Jacquard Polyester Geneva Champagne Oversized Bedspread - Grande Cal King - Luxury Bedroom Collection - 24 Inch Drop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9118mIywLTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👑 SIGNATURE DESIGN 👑 - Made with you in mind, the Geneva Bedspread is one of our exclusives, which means you won't find anything like it anywhere else. Without a doubt in our mind, you are worthy of home decor as unique, elegant and beautiful as you. Decorate and dress your household atmosphere with distinction. 👑 SIGHTWORTHY BEDDING 👑 - Imagine for a moment, a bedroom once empty, now filled. Or picture your bedroom, in desperate need for a spark, revived once again to a new state of glory. If you have an affinity for traditional, vintage decor, this ensemble makes for an extraordinary way to either renovate or refine your sanctuary of rest. Stage your sleeping environment elegantly, you deserve to feel that internal decadence. 👑 SOPHISTICATED CRAFTSMANSHIP 👑 - Created and curated exclusively for you, we have ensured a foundational quality to what is an already wonderful aesthetic. Oversized, jacquard-woven polyester bedspread features Jacobean floral damask in dark gray, gold, paprika, taupe, and sienna on a champagne ground. Bedspread has a 24 drop, coordinating striped trim, wavy quilting, tailored edges, and a champagne back. Bedding fill is polyester. 👑 SPLENDOROUS GIFT CHOICE 👑 - Whether it is your significant other or close friend dear to your heart, a bedding overlay like this one brings an affectionate appreciation to them. Watch them recieve warmly, thankful for someone as thoughtful as you. 👑SPECIFICATIONS & PRODUCT CARE 👑 - For oversized bedspread, choose Grande Queen, Grande King, or Grande Cal King. The Geneva Jacobean Damask Oversized Bedspread is polyester. Fill is polyester. Imported. Dry clean only. Matching Curtains & Decorative Pillows Available Separately","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9118mIywLTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Touch of Class","source_asin":"B09FC7QYWC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FC7QYWC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FC7QYWC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
