window.products.push({"id":679124,"name":"Salad Dressing Container To Go, Compatible with Bentgo Kids Lunch Box, 2x 3oz Small Containers with Lids, Premium Silicone, Easy Open Snack Containers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EsAda-3XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Compatible with Bentgo】Design specifically for bentgo kids lunch box. Comes with 2 containers and a sealing stopper to effectively solve the liquid leakage problem of the round salad dressing compartment, making it the perfect accessory for Bentgo lovers. 【Food Safe & Eco-Friendly】The dips sauce container is made of 100% food-grade silicone. Free of BPA, PVC and lead. Also, it is safe to use in the freezer, microwave, boiling water and oven up to 425 degrees Fahrenheit. Best of all, just throw them in the dishwasher for quick and easy cleaning. 【Easy Open Colorful Lids】The flexible silicone salad dressing container is so easy to open and close, just gently pull the handle to open it, so easy for your kids. The colorful lightweight small containers are ideal as a to-go snack container for children. 【Leakproof & Portable】100% airtight food containers with lids can prevent leakage, gives you absolute confidence to hold liquids or sauces and keep food fresh, no need to worry about spilling or soiling your meal bags. Enjoy dipping sauces and snacks on the go with our lightweight dressing containers. 【Perfect Size】This small 3-ounce (2.9*2.3*1.4inch) container is perfect for sauces, fruit, nuts, and more. The right size can fit into most bento boxes, providing the perfect compartment isolation for your lunch box. Easily enrich your lunch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61EsAda-3XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"fruui","source_asin":"B0BYC6TFQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYC6TFQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYC6TFQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":679125,"name":"New York Wall Art for Bedroom, SZ Urban NY City Picture Print on Canvas, Landmark Landscape Home Decorations (Waterproof Artwork, 1\" Thick Frame, Brac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ctpjAlarL._AC_.jpg","description":"Size: 30x30cm x 4 piece (12x12 inch x 4 panels)Waterproof: YesECO-ink print: YesUV resistant: YesMaterial: Wood and CanvasType: Giclee PrintedReady hanging, no handy work to screw the accessory kits. PACKAGE: All canvas wall art are wrapped on frames, bracket mounted, protected by plastic bags and carton box. HANGING: Arrange the positions, draw the center point on its top line, and then nail 3/5-inch under the point, aim the bracket and hang.P.S.: The bracket has sawtooth for balance adjustment. 3 YEARS WORKMANSHIP: - We would like to accept return and refund for you, please contact us by \"Sold by SZ HD Painting\" then \"Ask a question\"!- If this canvas picture scratched or damaged, please help tell us ahead and it doesn't affect the refund. CUSTOMIZED PRINTING: Our canvas prints can also be custom-made for your own size, photos or pictures, contact us by \"Sold by SZ HD Painting\" then \"Ask a question\"! APPLICATIONS: This museum-quality wall art uses for living room, bedroom, kitchen, dining room, bathroom, hallway, guest room, sitting room, office, cave, dorm, hotel, cafe, restaurant, bar, guesthouse, KTV, Gym or upon fireplace, behind couch in your nice house. PURPOSES: - This is an modern decorative way to highlight your unique artsy taste.- Stunning home decorations that earning compliments from your guests.- Contemporary wall paintings for any space to remove boring blank.- Bring in a peaceful dream world that relaxing and inspiring your family everyday.There's one more canvas painting to make your new home completed.Even a small warm piece can make a difference in your life.You can order and check this inspirational wall art, love it or your money back. Let's wake up your wall, \"Add to Cart\" now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ctpjAlarL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SZ HD Painting","source_asin":"B00MKZ2O6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MKZ2O6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MKZ2O6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":679126,"name":"Gdrasuya10 Over Sink Dish Drying Rack, Stainless Steel Kitchen Storage Rack Kitchen Sink Shelf Dish Drainer for Kitchen Counter Organization Storage S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xVS4H0bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description:Do you often worry about the messy kitchen? The over sink dish drying rack also includes a cutting board rack, chopstick barrel, cup holder, paper towel holder, cleaning basket, knife rack, etc. it makes full use of the space above the sink and can store most kitchen supplies at one time to meet daily needs. The high-end stainless steel material is durable and saves your use cost. It is a good choice for home life.Details:【Snap-Fit】The snap-fit design allows the additional holders to be easily disassembled, which is also conducive to cleaning.【Card Slot】The card slot of the dish drying rack has been deepened so that the items can be placed more stably, and damage can be reduced.【Inclined Cup Holder】The cup holder adopts an inclined design, which is conducive to the outflow of residual liquid.【Chopstick Barrel】The chopstick barrel is equipped with holes, so it is breathable and easy to drain and dry.Specification:Color: BlackMaterial: 304 Stainless SteelMaximum Load: 30kg/ 60lbsNet Weight: 2.5kg/ 5.51lbsGross Weight: 3kg/ 6.61lbsProduct Size: 87 x 30 x 55cm/ 34.25 x 11.81 x 21.65inchPackage Size: 34.5 x 32.5 x 17.5cm/ 13.58 x 12.8 x 6.89inchPackage Included:1 x Cup Holder1 x Cutting Board Rack1 x Chopsticks Barrel1 x Tool Holder1 x Cleaning Basket1 x Knife Rack1 x Paper Towel Holder1 x Dish Rack2 x Bowl Racks5 x HooksAll Accessories for InstallationNote:Before buying, please carefully check the size on the product picture to see if it matches your kitchen. The important thing is that the distance between the faucet and the wall should be greater than 1.5cm/0.59inch, and the faucet height should be less than 44cm/ 17.32inch. Tips:1. Please allow the slight color difference caused by the shooting light and 1-2cm error due to manual measurement. Please make sure you do not mind before you order.2. We aim to provide customers with high-quality products and good services, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with a satisfactory answer within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xVS4H0bzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gdrasuya10","source_asin":"B09WMT2YGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WMT2YGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WMT2YGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
