window.products.push({"id":679179,"name":"Light When Dad Farts Soy Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N0LS28plL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"DETAILS: -16.5 oz soy -Lead free wick -All natural, hand poured, small batch -Burns roughly 100 hours -4\" x 4\" -Made in the USA SCENT DESCRIPTIONS: Amber Noir:A sweet & sultry fusion of mandarin, jasmine & rich amber with undertones of sandalwood and musk. It's a clean warm scent perfect for anytime of the year.Toasted Pumpkin:Toasty top notes of cinnamon, nutmeg & clove give way to middle accords of silky buttercream & pumpkin. A base of smoked embers & vanilla gives this scent a warm twist on a classic fall fragrance.Apple Harvest:A true, ripe apple fragrance combined with bright fruit notes & just a touch of spice. Top notes include orange peel, cinnamon & nutmeg, middle note of apple & a base of clove & vanilla.Christmas Tree:Fill your home with the aroma of an evergreen forest. This scent opens with refreshing ozone, bay laurel & cooling eucalyptus. Middle notes of cypress, moss, and bayberry blend with rich undertones of fir balsam, patchouli, and sweet incense.Black Sea:This scent is a fresh, clean, light cologne scent. The sweet yet salty oceanic accords combine with an undercurrent of amber. Top notes include citrus, sea salt, and ozone. Middles notes of plum and cardamom and base notes of amber and black musk.Moonlight Path:Inspired by the original Moonlight Path scent, this is a soft floral musk scent enhanced by jasmine and rose. This scent is a soft musk blended with sheer lavender and lily of the valley and gives a clean elegant comforting aroma.Eucalyptus Spearmint:This scent has a eucalyptus heart enhanced with fresh minty notes. This is a clean relaxing aroma perfect for all year round!Mahogany Teakwood:Inspired by the original Mahogany Teakwood, this is the perfect cologne scent that everyone will love. Dry notes of Mahogany & teakwood perfectly mixed with bergamot, sweet citron, ylang ylang & cinnamon bark.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71N0LS28plL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baum Designs","source_asin":"B07SGL4G99","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SGL4G99","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SGL4G99","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
