window.products.push({"id":679367,"name":"Air Pump Air Mattress Pump for Inflatables Blow up Pool Raft Bed Boat Toy, Quick-Fill Electric Air Pump for Outdoor Camping, Inflatable Cushions, Air ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtBYQj1uL._AC_SL1485_.jpg","description":"➤ Easy to Use -- The inflatable mattress pump is compatible with 12V DC and 110V AC power supply. To inflatable, just put the inflatable head at the filling hold, then press the switch. To deflate, you should put the inflatable head in the vent hole, then press the switch to deflate. Our electric air mattress pumps are simple to operate. ➤Powerful Electric Air Pump -- The air pumps are so powerful that it can not only inflate items but also deflate products by sucking air out! Store away your duvet, bed sheets, towels, blankets, and more! Car power adapter and home power adapter are included, making it possible for indoor and outdoor use. ( NOTE: This air pump is not rechargeable and DO NOT FOR BALLOONS!!!!!! ) ➤ 3 Nozzles to Choose -- We have 3 nozzles of different size in the electric air mattress pumps – S, M and L, allowing you to inflate/deflate different items in any occasions! The portable pump’s nozzles stay lock-secured on the electric air pump during use。 ➤ Convenient & Portable -- The inflatable mattress pump is small and lightweight, making it convenient to use it indoor and outdoor. At a travel-friendly dimension, you can easily take air pumps anywhere you go! ➤Multi-Purpose -- Including car power adapter & home power adapter. This inflatable mattress pump is a powerful inflator and deflator for both indoor and outdoor use, especially for travel and outdoor activities. air pumps helps you saving time on inflating air cushions, air beds, air boats, inflatable furniture, swimming ring and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YtBYQj1uL._AC_SL1485_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yoocylii","source_asin":"B07VCM23M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VCM23M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VCM23M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":679368,"name":"Cupcake Cone Baking Rack Cooling Rack 16 Cones Decorate Display And Serve All In One","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWXv7OGeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cupcakes and ice cream cones are the perfect combination, whether you're a kid or an adult. Now you can make your own cupcake cones in this convenient baking rack. Just fill it with sugar or cake cones, add your batter, set the rack on a cookie sheet and place in oven to bake. Bake, decorate and serve right from the rack You can decorate and serve the cupcake cones right from the rack, too! Kids can help decorate with their favorite sprinkles and candy. Cupcakes are just the beginning Cones aren’t just for cupcakes. Use them to hold popcorn, chocolate covered nuts or fruit. Set up an ice cream bar for your next party by filling the baking rack with cones dipped in Wilton Candy Melts Candy, sprinkles and sugars. There’s no limit to the fun food ideas you can create using this baking rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DWXv7OGeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Protecker","source_asin":"B07JMCXVS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JMCXVS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JMCXVS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
