window.products.push({"id":679464,"name":"Celery Juicer Machine Slow Masticating Juicers Cold Press Juicer Real Easy Clean Extractor for Vegetable Fruit 1.8 inch Chute Quite Low db","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NqDXNjxcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEW Design-Our celery juicer applied double propeller structure which perfectly avoids clogged when juicing fiber-rich materials such as celery. Combined the screw and filter of the masticating juicer, the juice extraction system runs stably without shaking. The juicer machine squeezing accuracy exceeds the level of 0.1mm, ensuring a ultra high juice yield SAVE MORE MONNEY compared to centrifugal juicers, that is the unique feature of vertical cold press masticating juicers. MORE HEATHY AND SAFE- Our celery juicer choose BPA-FREE food-grade plastic material (Tritan) to prevent the juice chemically changed during the juice extraction process. A slow masticating juicer like the Viesimple Large Caliber Juicer rather than a centrifugal juicer also prevents the rapid oxidation which can be caused by the high-speed spinning of a centrifugal juicer. REAL EASY TO CLEAN-The filter of this cold press juicer is a double-layer grid structure. Different from the traditional steel stainless strainer easy clogged by thousands of meshes, when you using our juicer is real easy to clean just by flushing water,even no need to use brush. HIGH QUALITY-The juice machine uses high-quality pure copper motors and optimized circuit board design. The solution has been tested thousands of times and has a lifespan of more than 10 years. Each juice machine undergoes 3 strict quality inspection procedures in the production process. The powerful 240W AC motor’s slow speed allows each and every piece of produce enough time to have its juice fully extracted, leaving behind only dry pulp and a delicious and nutritious juice. 2 YEARS WARRANTY– We provide 2 Yeas Warranty for our masticating juicer and 24 Hours Online Service.We employs a very strict quality control system to ensure your product is in working order and up to your standards. Kindly Reminder: 1. There is a blue protection film on the surface. Please remove it before use. 2. The screw maybe a little bit tight when you use at first time, it will be more easy to take apart after several times using!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NqDXNjxcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viesimple","source_asin":"B0BHZLKX32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZLKX32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZLKX32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
