window.products.push({"id":679544,"name":"Luigi Bormioli Michelangelo Masterpiece 19 1/4-Ounce All Purpose Goblets, Set of 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X0JF4K3FL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Luigi Bormioli used only the finest sands and raw materials to produce crystalline glass that is purely transparent, completely free from tarnishes, tints, and imperfections. Through an innovative cold-crack procedure and careful fire-polishing, the rims of Luigi Bormioli stems and tumblers retain the beadless edge found on the world's finest crystal. Designed with Italian precision and manufactured with Italian craftmanship, Luigi Bormioli's blown crystal glass provides you with the elegance and practicality that you deserve. Dishwasher safe yet beautiful enough for all of your entertainment needs, our stemware, tumblers and serveware allow you to experience fine Italian glassware while meeting the demands of your everyday life. Amazon.com Add luster to any occasion with this tasteful set of six large goblets shimmering at the table. Perfect for a substantial serving of full-bodied red wine, a fine Barbera vintage, or any assortment of beverages from fancy cocktails to chilled water, these large 19-ounce goblets are an excellent choice for entertaining. Suitable with any setting and décor, the classic profile and brilliant clarity, blown from pure lead-free crystal, complements other stemware in the elegant Michelangelo Masterpiece collection. For generations, the skillful creativity of Luigi Bormioli patterns, named after renowned musicians and artists, offers flawless quality and superior craftsmanship. Imported from Italy, this refined glassware is also surprisingly dishwasher-safe. --Roberta Cruger","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31X0JF4K3FL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luigi Bormioli","source_asin":"B0002D0SCK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002D0SCK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002D0SCK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
