window.products.push({"id":679572,"name":"CHARMAID Rustic Wall Mounted Jewelry Organizer Cabinet, Wooden Jewelry Holder Box with Barndoor, Removable Bracelets Rod, Hooks Shelf, Mesh Jewelry Or","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VO9nLGxcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity & Multifunctional Jewelry Storage】: The jewelry holder features compact design yet providing roomy storage compartments inside for your beautiful jewelry. There are multiple metal hooks that keep your necklaces organized, a large metal mesh for earrings, a padded slot for earring and more humanized design. 【Customize the Mounting Height as You Want】: The jewelry organizer is already assembled. And what you need to do is just mount it in your desired height, either according to your room configuration or based on your own need. The predrilled holes on the holder and included screws make it simple enough mounting the cabinet in minutes. 【100% Wood for Years of Use】: Delicately made from 100% natural paulownia wood, the jewelry organizer box features exceptional sturdiness for years of rough use. Meanwhile, its smooth surface enables you to keep it clean by means of a soft cloth, while its natural texture delivers unique looking design. 【Barn Style Door & Reinforced Connection】: Barn style doors can not only secure your jewelry from the entering of dust but also secure them to get rid of damage. Compared with spare mesh holder, the organizer equipped with doors is safer to some extent. The magnets help you to close the door more easily as well. Reinforced strong hinge enhance the sturdiness further. 【Perfect Gift for Lovers & Fabulous Decoration】: The retro jewelry holder will be a perfect decoration in your house, from living room to entryway, from dressing room to bedroom. After all, it is not difficult to find this furnish combines both practicality and aesthetic beauty. Needless to say, it is also a perfect gift for yourself, for your lovers, for your mother.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VO9nLGxcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHARMAID","source_asin":"B08PD9XWGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PD9XWGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PD9XWGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
