window.products.push({"id":679621,"name":"overstockArt Corner of The Garden at Montgeron Artwork by Monet with Verona Gold Braid Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91naxGY8d-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Handmade oil painting reproduction of a famous Claude Monet painting , Corner of the Garden at Montgeron. The original masterpiece was created in 1876-77. Today it has been carefully recreated detail-by-detail, color-by-color to near perfection. While Monet successfully captured life's reality in many of his works, his aim was to analyze the ever-changing nature of color and light. Known as the classic impressionist, one can not help but have deep admiration for his talent. This work of art has the same emotions and beauty as the original. Why not grace your home with this reproduced masterpiece? It is sure to bring many admirers! Frame Description: Verona Gold Braid Frame From the Manufacturer OverstockArt is an art manufacturer of framed hand painted oil reproductions and canvas art prints. overstockArt was among the earliest online galleries of hand painted oil paintings and the first to focus on art reproductions of great masters such as Van Gogh, Monet and Klimt. From Impressionist art to Modern Art, overstockArt has the perfect framed canvas art for your home. At overstockArt, we live and breathe the oil paintings that surround us and feel we have a special connection with our customers. Put simply, we are art lovers serving art lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91naxGY8d-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Pastiche","source_asin":"B00PISRZ0M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PISRZ0M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PISRZ0M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":679622,"name":"GSlife Over The Sink Dish Drying Rack, 2 Tier Stainless Steel Dish Rack Over Sink Organizer Shelf for Kitchen, Easy to Assemble, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716P9PMQ5+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-rust Dish Rack - Adopted premium 201 stainless steel and processed polishing and welding, this dish drying rack is non-rust and long-lasting Stable Dish Rack - The Lengthen bend foot of dish rack make the rack's centre of gravity forward to balance the top weight and more stable; The non-skidding rubber feet will keep the dish rack more steady Dimension - Outside dimension: 34(L) x 11(W) x 32(H) inches; Inside dimension: 32.5 (L) x 9.3 (W) x 32 (H) inches; The height of the faucet should be ≤ 16.5 inch; The length of the sink should be < 31.5 inch Saving Space - The 2 tier over the sink dish drying rack used the space aobve the sink and keep all the cooking utensils and cups tidy, dry clean easily Easy to Assemble - We offer detailed instruction for you to install easily. We provide 12 month warranty for this over sink dish rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716P9PMQ5+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GSlife","source_asin":"B08CSDY5M8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CSDY5M8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CSDY5M8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":679623,"name":"Creative Cats Oven Mitts and Potholders (2-Piece Sets) - Kitchen Set with Cotton Heat Resistant,Oven Gloves for BBQ Cooking Baking Grilling","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eMU5zDcvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Imagine the aroma in your home from delicious pie baking in the oven. The oven timer beeps and the pie has turned a glowing, golden brown. It’s ready. Take all the stress of removing the hot pie dish from the scorching oven with these Oven Mitts / Gloves. Insert your hands into the cotton lined deep gloves . The premium polyester filling provides pure protection and safe insulation from hot items. These gloves allow you to get a secure hold on the cookware you are carrying, so there’s no risk of dropping your delicious pie. Meanwhile, the deep pockets point your hands away from the hot item so as to reduce the risk of any hot steam or grease contacting your skin. These gloves are great for added protection to your forearms. This Mitts are ideal for holding dishes, pots, plates, bowls and so much more. They allow you to grip a variety kitchen items and utensils of different sizes to protect your hands from extreme temperatures. We also find them useful for opening hard-to-open jar lids because of the ripped texture that grips so well. They are designed to suit many decor styles and can be stored neatly in a drawer or hung using the handy sewn-in hanging tab with metal loop. The mitts are easy care – hand wash and lay flat to dry. antkondnm– savor the good life. antkondnm luxury performance kitchen textiles offer a new level of quality, durability and style. Our products are built for comfort and long lasting performance. Enjoy! The colors you see on your screen may not be a totally accurate reproduction of the actual product. We strive to make our colors as accurate as possible, but screen images are intended as a guide only and should not be regarded as absolutely correct.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eMU5zDcvL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"antkondnm","source_asin":"B086HFWSZ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679623","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HFWSZ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HFWSZ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
