window.products.push({"id":679838,"name":"DAPU Pure Stone Washed Linen Pillowcases 1 Pair Woven from 100% Fine French Natural Flax(White, King)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YSbboI4JL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100% French Linen with Stone Washed— DAPU has carefully sourced linen fabric woven from certified high grade French flax and stone washed for nice color, glossiness as well as soft hand feeling. Feel wonderful all year round— Linen pillowcases are naturally breathable, which helps to keep you cooler in the summer and toasty throughout the winter months. Easy care and durable— Linen has no lint or pilling tendency, and softens the more it is used and washed. Linen fabrics is hard-wearing and durable. 100% machine washable— Use the gentle machine cycle and a mild detergent to protect the fibers. Line dry inside out. Warm iron inside out if required. Do not dry clean. Includes 2 pillowcases, queen size: 20\" x 30\", king size: 20\" x 40\".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31YSbboI4JL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DAPU","source_asin":"B08FSYVD43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FSYVD43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FSYVD43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":679839,"name":"BELLA 14024 Programmable Slow Cooker with Locking Lid, 6-Quart, Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B35uevvsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Featuring a locking lid that seals tight for travel to family dinners, potlucks, and other events, the 6-Quart Programmable Slow Cooker simplifies meal planning and preparation by slow cooking meats and veggies to lock in moisture and flavor. The programmable time and temperature settings ensure a perfectly cooked meal every time, while the stoneware pot is removable for easy kitchen-to-table serving. When it's time to clean up, the pot and tempered-glass lid can go right in the dishwasher. And because the slow cooker uses less energy than your oven, it's an eco-sensitive choice. 6-Quart Programmable Slow Cooker with Locking Lid At a Glance: Seals in moisture and slow cooks for healthy, tasty meals Seals in moisture and slow cooks for healthy, tasty meals Locking lid lets you transport meals with no spills Locking lid lets you transport meals with no spills Programmable timer for 30 minutes to 20 hours of cooking Programmable timer for 30 minutes to 20 hours of cooking Stoneware pot lifts out for serving and cleaning Stoneware pot lifts out for serving and cleaning Sleek and durable stainless steel finish Sleek and durable stainless steel finish Locking lid prevents spills or leaks during transport. Locking lid for safe travel. View larger . Lid stays upright for serving. View larger . Built-in spoon rest and included spoon. View larger . Set the Timer and Go With the 6-Quart Programmable Slow Cooker, it's easy to create healthy, great-tasting meals with meats, vegetables, and grains. The stoneware pot provides plenty of space to assemble ingredients hours before you plan to eat. The 30-minute-to-20-hour digital countdown timer ensures your meal will be perfectly cooked when you want it. One-pot cooking also makes for less mess and fewer dirty dishes to clean. Seals in Moisture to Increase Flavor Thanks to its tempered-glass lid, the cooker seals in flavor by locking in moisture, so even tougher cuts of meat become tender and delicious. Vegetables and grains absorb the rich flavors of stocks and seasoning. Locking Lid for Safe, Easy Travel The lid securely locks for travel, so you can share your favorite dishes at family get-togethers, potluck dinners, and barbecues. The locking lid ensures your dishes won't spill or leak during transport. When it's time to eat, press the front lid lock button and use the lid handle to open the lid--it will stay upright for serving. For added convenience, the slow cooker comes with a spoon, and the lid features a built-in spoon rest. Choose from Three Temperature Settings The slow cooker can operate at the low setting all day or night, meaning you can put ingredients in the pot in the morning and come home at the end of the day to a fully cooked meal. Foods will cook on high in about half the time required for low cooking. When cooking is complete, the warm setting will keep the food at the perfect temperature for up to four hours. It's easy to try new dishes--experimenting with curry, enchiladas, bread pudding, and more is as simple as throwing in the ingredients and walking away. Removable Pot for Easy Serving and Cleaning When it's time to serve your meal, the pot lifts out of the slow cooker, so you can bring it directly to the table. For easy cleaning, both the pot and the tempered-glass lid are dishwasher safe. 6-Quart Capacity for Large Gatherings This 6-quart cooker can cook a 7.5-pound ham, 4-to-6-pound whole chicken, or a 4-to-5-pound brisket. It's the perfect size for making meals that serve up to six people. Durable and Stylish Stainless Steel Design Featuring sleek, durable stainless steel construction this slow cooker adds style to your kitchen. To keep the finish looking great, wipe clean after use. Energy-Efficient Cooking This slow cooker uses less energy than most ovens, making it a more eco-sensitive cooking choice. What's in the Box 6-Quart Programmable Slow Cooker with locking lid, tempered-glass lid, stoneware pot, spoon, and user manual with recipes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B35uevvsL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BELLA","source_asin":"B00EXOZ7V6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EXOZ7V6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EXOZ7V6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
