window.products.push({"id":679988,"name":"6 Succulent Pots with 6 Artificial Faux Succulents，Ceramic Plants Pots with Plastic Potted Fake Succulents,Ceramic Planter Pots with Drain Hole-Plant ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pnW1Rs7MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package included 6 x life-like faux succulents 6 x Cylindrical Ceramic 6 x Cylindrical Bamboo Saucer Trays  General dimension:3.3”Hx3.3”W Pot size: 3”Hx3”W  ➤➤Material: High quality CERAMIC material (produced with top-quality clay heated up to 2300F） ➤➤Succulent Plants Pots in the most recent updated design : The design brings a strong decor touch to your house, giving your working space a lively and fresh look with vivid plants. Besides planter pots, they can be used as a pencil holder, a fun decoration for the home, garden, patio or office and so on. Crafted with Excellence in Mind Allfeiya home and office decor pieces are painstakingly designed with every single detail in mind. From the flocking on our flowers, to the delicate thinness of our ceramic pots, each aspect of our design pieces are obsessed over before even reaching prototype stage. While photos tell half the story, the quality difference of our products becomes obvious when experienced in person. Secure Packaging and Delivery Shipping routes and delivery handling can be a dangerous journey for our succulents pots with artificial succulents. That is why we have gone through more than 5 different iterations of our packaging to ensure that your flowers arrive in pristine condition. Nevertheless, rest assured that even if the worst were to occur, all Allfeiya products are backed by us to arrive defect proof in pristine condition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pnW1Rs7MS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALLFEIYA","source_asin":"B08YDBPMKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDBPMKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDBPMKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":679989,"name":"Bluesea 39 Feet Chimney Sweep Kit, Ergonomic Chimney Cleaning Kit, Extends Up to 39 Feet, Chimney Cleaner, Chimney Cleaning Tools, Chimney Cleaning Sy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":87.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbYxCmhaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【THE LATEST GENERATION DESIGN】The chimney sweep kit has a sturdy, nice chrome button locking system to ensure that it will not loosen in any direction of rotation (clockwise or counterclockwise). Each of our chrome button locking chimney rods has a length of 39.3 inches. Compared with ordinary rods, it can reach the length you want and can reduce the number of connected rods. In this way, the number of connecting rods will be reduced, which can greatly save cleaning time. ✅【PERMIUM CHIMNEY SWEEP KIT】The chimney brush bristle is made from strong nylon string, with a special sharp edged rectangular shape, which makes the sweep more efficiency.The chimney brush rods are made from nylon,elastic and chemically resistant.The head of rods has corrosion resistance and always maintain a bright surface. It will not be broken or getting stuck in the flue during cleaning. ✅【EASY TO USE 】It is easy to assemble and disassemble by pressing the button. This chimney cleaning kit can effectively sweep away soot and creosote buildup from bottom of your hearth.The chimney brush is suitable for pipes of various shapes and sizes.It can clean other difficult-to-reach areas quickly & easily. Make your cleaning endeavors something that is more easier. ✅【HELP PREVENT FLUE FIRES】The chimney sweep kit sweep away dangerous soot and creosote build-up from inside the chimney or on the roof to help prevent flue fires.When the chimney is cleaned, the air enters the chimney more smoothly, which can help burn more completely in the fireplace and make the room warmer.It can also help you save the professional service costs of the chimney cleaning. ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDING】12 Qty. 39.3 inches Flexible Chrome Button Locking Chimney Rods;1 Qty. Flexible Chimney Brush;1 Qty. Gripper Gloves;1 Qty. Heavy Duty Plastic Sheet ;1 Qty. Collection Bag;1 Qty. Metal Drill Attachment;1 Qty. Hex Key;1 Qty. Instruction Manual. If you have any questions about the product, please feel free to contact us, we will do our best to help you solve it.Our service and excellent quality will make you completely satisfied.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tbYxCmhaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bluesea","source_asin":"B08GPB3TK1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-679989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GPB3TK1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GPB3TK1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
